# Capacitor iOS wrapper. The native project is generated, not committed:
# `npx cap add ios` scaffolds it from the Capacitor template on every CI run
# and on each fresh clone, and `npm run ios:configure` re-applies the
# Info.plist keys, entitlement, signing settings and shared scheme on top.
# See docs/ios-release.md.
#
# `npx cap add ios` refuses to run when ios/ already exists, so nothing may
# be committed inside it. To switch to a committed native project, remove
# the ios/ line below and force-add the tree; the workflow detects
# ios/App/App.xcodeproj and runs `npx cap sync ios` instead of `cap add`.
www/
ios/
DerivedData/
